temFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯宣布发布混元Hy4及Hy4flash模型，强化思维链与视觉理解能力</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软2027财年首季从OpenAI相关合作获利100亿美元</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic内部Claude模型攻破五大主流系统并发现大量高危漏洞</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布 Gemini 4 Carbon 模型，以 59 分重夺 Intelligence Index 榜首</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5fb85d629d94f4850f68d36199c3aa1d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google DeepMind 正式推出新一代旗舰模型 Gemini 4 Carbon，在 Artificial Analysis 的 Intelligence Index v5.0 中以 59 分位列第一，超越 Claude Opus 5.5 与 GPT-6 Astra。该模型在 Arena.ai 的 Text Arena 登顶，Agent Arena 位列第二。Gemini 4 Carbon 核心聚焦长时程工程与网络安全，支持连续数天运转以处理大型代码库。在安全领域，其打通漏洞发现、验证与修复全链路，SEC-bench Pro 达 88.2%，CWE-bench 达 71.0%，安全代码生成成功率较 Argon 提升两倍。可靠性方面，Terminal-Bench 4.0 中模型“作弊”成功率为 0，间接提示</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达拟投资30亿美元入股Meta并扩大AI基础设施合作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/df6e2b264a845e8866cb9de8ca1699c7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达计划投资30亿美元参与Meta的股权融资，双方将进一步深化在AI基础设施与技术领域的合作。Meta此次融资目标最高为950亿美元，旨在加速AI基础设施建设。作为合作核心，Meta将在下一代AI代理程序中深度集成英伟达硬件，包括Vera Rubin系统与Vera CPU，并围绕Meta的AI产品Muse扩大技术协作。此外，AMD与博通亦表达了合计购买至多50亿美元Meta股票的意向。此举延续了芯片厂商与大型科技公司通过资本绑定构建算力生态的模式，即英伟达向客户提供资金，客户再将其投入至搭载英伟达芯片的数据中心建设中。市场分析指出，这种“循环融资”模式在推动算力扩张的同时，其真实需求匹配度与可持续性正受到行业持续审视。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯宣布发布混元Hy4及Hy4flash模型，强化思维链与视觉理解能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/be4b1431b360d9ee498f60b9a23ac46f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯在2026全球数字生态大会上宣布，新一代大语言模型混元Hy4即将发布。相较于此前开源的Hy4preview（770B参数、49B激活参数、1M上下文），Hy4在长程任务处理、真实生产力场景及思维链效率上实现全面提升，并首次引入视觉理解能力。此外，主打极致性价比的Hy4flash模型也将在近期推出，该模型通过模型与产品的深度Co-Design实现高频进化，在继承Hy4视觉理解及Agent能力的基础上，进一步优化实用性。此次更新标志着腾讯混元系列在模型能力与工程化落地方面迈出重要一步，旨在通过更高效的推理与多模态交互，满足行业对复杂生产力任务的深度需求。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软2027财年首季从OpenAI相关合作获利100亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0f4300690cd50684397f89db68d9d269.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软2027财年首季（截至2026年9月30日）财报显示，其通过与OpenAI的合作实现100亿美元收入，占当季923亿美元总营收的近11%。若该增长态势持续，年化规模有望达400亿美元。双方合作深度进一步绑定，根据今年4月修订的协议，OpenAI承诺在2030年前持续向微软分润，并承诺未来额外采购2500亿美元Azure算力资源。尽管微软持有的OpenAI股份比例从6月的25%降至9月的24%，但双方的商业纽带愈发紧密。目前OpenAI仍有72亿美元应收账款挂在微软名下。分析认为，双方已演变为“既是伙伴又是对手”的复杂联盟，在企业客户、生成式AI平台及开发工具领域展开竞争的同时，通过Azure基础设施依赖与长期分成机制实现深度利益捆绑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic内部Claude模型攻破五大主流系统并发现大量高危漏洞</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4874f5a00ff55f1e2572bbe64943156c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic近日发布研究报告，披露其内部Claude研究模型在Chrome、Safari、Android、Windows及Linux五大主流系统中成功发现大量漏洞，并自主串联成5条高危攻击链。在Chrome中，模型挖掘出62个严重漏洞，涵盖沙箱逃逸及渲染进程控制；Safari测试中，模型通过“一次点击”攻击链绕过同源策略，窃取敏感隐私数据。针对Android，模型在Pixel 9锁屏状态下通过USB缺陷提取本地照片。在桌面端，Windows系统被发现CVE-2026-33096高危漏洞，导致HTTP/3服务崩溃；Linux系统则被发现CVE-2026-98432零点击远程代码执行漏洞，模型仅用53分钟便完成内核指针泄露并获取root shell权限。目前，上述漏洞均已通过协调披露流程完成修复。该研究展示了</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
